了一张满是潮红的容颜，宛如盛夏那嫣红的抽水芙蓉！刹那间，看清了女人容貌的林飞，却是一阵愕然，神智甚至有些恍惚……男人的手颤抖着，喉结鼓动。仿佛在记忆深处，一幕幕原本被玫瑰花瓣所尘封的画面，宛如岁月酿制的苦酒，让他深陷其中，糜醉地难以自拔。无数的画面与往事，涌上心头……过了足足十几秒钟，林飞才猛地回过神来，伸手拍打了下女人的脸蛋。“小姐，小姐！”林飞喊了几声，女人却依然昏迷不醒，林飞一皱眉，用手指撑开了女人的眼皮，看了一会儿，又伸手去她颈部动脉处感受了下。“瞳孔双侧放大，脉搏微弱，看来是窒息性缺氧昏迷，这下糟糕了……”林飞虽然有猜到这麻袋里或许装着是人，但没想到这女人还喝过酒，并且被封住了嘴。麻袋里本就空气不通畅，再加上女人早就被那俩大汉打晕，身体被捆绑着血脉不顺。车后备箱更是封闭的地方，连着车子又如此疯狂地各种加速与绕弯，她就算醒过来都会被撞晕过去。这么下去，以林飞的经验来看，很可能因为脑部长时间缺氧，心脏供血不足，而导致大脑产生后遗症。看着这张让他无法忽视的容颜，林飞顾不得其他，伸手直接解开了女人胸前的几颗扣子，敞开了制服。没想到女人里面竟然只穿了一件黑色镂空纹蕾丝文胸，透过那一丝丝的缝隙，能看到粉白雪嫩，大好的风光。可林飞压根没心思去注意女人的惊人上围，他需要给她做心脏按压，想要获取好的效果，胸口处自然不能有别的累赘。林飞面色严峻地把女人的文胸也直接扯下，两只手叠着放到了她的胸口处，难免碰到她的柔软弹性部位，却也顾不得太多。林飞一边给她做着按压，一边不停地说着话，“小姐！小姐你听得到我说话吗？你醒醒……”林飞努力地想唤回女人的意识，只有唤起意识，才能尽快逃离危险期。可心脏的回应还是不强烈，女人似乎自主呼吸的能力正逐渐减弱，看来缺氧时间的确太久了。“该死的！”林飞心头着急，不管三七二十一，用力地捏住了女人的瑶鼻，低头用嘴覆在女人的檀口上，开始做人工呼吸。另一只手则没有放弃地继续在女人心口处按压，配合着一定的心脏跳动频率。正当这时，不远处忽然车灯闪烁，一辆黑色的大众轿车疾驰过来！林飞抬头，顿时一愣，郁闷地快要吐血，早不晚晚不来，那车怎么找到这里来了！？可他急着救人，先懒得多管，继续给女人做人工呼吸。车子停下后，立刻从驾驶室跑出来一个人。“住手！你在干什么！？”林飞抬头，才发现追来的竟然还是一个年轻貌美的女人！？女子身高足足至少有一米七三以上，乌黑的垂肩发丝整齐地对半分着，贴在莹润白皙的鹅蛋脸两侧，弯弯的柳眉下，一双明媚的眼眸带着一股子独有的冷漠和锐气。一身黑色T恤，浅色贴身牛仔裤，勾勒的曲线宛如艺术家手下的女神雕塑。这是一个古典美女，浑身上下都透着东方的韵味，但偏偏，却又是一个超模身材，顿时，一种强烈冲击的结合美感，让人有些难以挪开目光。可这女人再美，林飞都没心思去欣赏。他看看被自己扒开了上衣，摘下胸罩的女人，又看看自己手放的位置，知道肯定被误会了，但也没心思解释，只道：“小姐，不管你信不信，我只是在帮这女人”“哼，刚才帮着劫匪开车逃逸的是你吧，说鬼话骗谁？而且我还是第一次看见，深更半夜，有男人是这么帮助一个女人的！”漂亮女子显然不相信，当她见到那两名已经倒下的大汉，则是立马神情戒备地一步步靠近了林飞。事实上，只要是个正常人，都不会相信林飞所说的话。要怪只能怪，这女人的美貌和身段，同样是女人都难以不动心，实在不像是正常男人能忍住的……林飞无奈地站起身来，眯了眯眼，他看出来，这个女人是要对自己动手。还以为这个女人会大喊大叫，有些意外。果然，女子咬着银牙，抬起一条修长的美腿，顺着一道刁钻的轨迹，就带着阵凛冽的刚风，朝着林飞踢了过来！林飞看到女人的这一脚法，面色波澜不惊，但心里暗忖：克格勃的格斗技巧？这女人到底什么来路！？与此同时，林飞不慌不忙地伸手一把接住了女人的这一刚猛踢腿。女人显然惊错无比，瞪大了美眸，不敢相信，这个男人可以轻易接住自己的这一脚！这可是连国内一般的特种兵都无法轻易接下的，这男人果然有蹊跷，难道是临安那伙神秘罪犯中一个！？她今天本是在调查案子线索的，结果在一家酒店后门发现一个似乎喝醉了的女人，被两名大汉给劫持了，装进了麻袋。她从对面的大楼急匆匆跑下来，想追赶，却让两大汉上了出租车，才又跑回去自己开车。之后的一幕幕，也就发生了。“哼，终于显露真实身份了么？”女子冷笑道。林飞露出一丝异色，“什么真实身份……”“还在装？不仅贩毒，还要祸害女人么”，女子不屑道。贩毒？这又是哪一出？但林飞反应也快，不禁思索着问道：“难道……你是警察？”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0003 The real identity of the woman was with her black hair hanging loosely, her hands and feet tied up, and her mouth taped. At this time, the woman seemed to have fainted. Lin Fei untied the rope from her body and lay flat on the ground, still unresponsive. I have to say that, just looking at her figure, she is already a rare beauty. Under the black socialite uniform, the surging ups and downs make it difficult to imagine that this is an oriental woman. With a height of at least 1.7 meters and her slightly exaggerated measurements, she looks like a European and American socialite with a devilish figure. Her skin was fair and pink, with red blood due to alcohol and long-term lack of oxygen coma. Lin Fei was somewhat looking forward to what kind of beauty a woman with such a figure would look like. He quickly tore off the tape on her mouth and reached out to push away the hair that was stuck to her face with sweat, revealing a face full of flushes, like the bright red hibiscus in midsummer! In an instant, Lin Fei, who saw the woman's appearance clearly, was stunned for a while, and his mind was even a little dazed... The man's hands were trembling, and his Adam's apple was bulging. It was as if in the depths of his memory, the scenes that were originally covered in rose petals were like the bitter wine brewed by the years, making him immersed in them, so intoxicated that he could not extricate himself. Countless pictures and past events came to mind... After more than ten seconds, Lin Fei suddenly came back to his senses and reached out to slap the woman on the face. \"Miss, Miss!\" Lin Fei shouted several times, but the woman was still unconscious. Lin Fei frowned, opened the woman's eyelids with his fingers, looked at it for a while, and then reached out to feel the artery in her neck. \"The pupils are dilated on both sides and the pulse is weak. It seems to be a coma due to asphyxiation and hypoxia. This is terrible...\" Although Lin Fei guessed that there might be a person in the sack, he did not expect that the woman had drunk alcohol and had her mouth sealed. The air in the sack was already blocked, and the woman had already been knocked unconscious by the two big men, and her body was tied up and her blood was not flowing smoothly. The trunk of the car was even more closed, and the car was accelerating and turning so crazily that she would be knocked unconscious even if she woke up. If this continues, judging from Lin Fei's experience, it is likely that the long-term lack of oxygen in the brain and insufficient blood supply to the heart will lead to sequelae in the brain. Seeing this face that he couldn't ignore, Lin Fei didn't care about anything else. He reached out and unbuttoned a few buttons on the woman's chest and opened his uniform. Unexpectedly, the woman was only wearing a black lace bra with hollow patterns. Through the tiny gaps, she could see the pink, white and tender scenery. But Lin Fei had no intention of paying attention to the woman's astonishing bust. He needed to perform heart compressions on her. If he wanted to achieve good results, he naturally couldn't have any other burdens on his chest. With a stern look on his face, Lin Fei pulled off the woman's bra, folded his hands and placed them on her chest. He would inevitably touch her soft and elastic parts, but he didn't care too much. Lin Fei was giving her compressions while he kept talking, \"Miss! Miss, can you hear me? Wake up...\" Lin Fei tried hard to awaken the woman's consciousness. Only by awakening consciousness can he escape from the dangerous period as soon as possible. But the heart's response is still not strong, and the woman's ability to breathe on her own seems to be gradually weakening. It seems that the time of lack of oxygen has indeed been too long. \"Damn it!\" Lin Fei was anxious, and regardless of the situation, he pinched the woman's nose hard, lowered his head and covered the woman's nose with his mouth, and began to perform artificial respiration. The other hand continued to press on the woman's heart without giving up, matching the heart's beating frequency to a certain rate. At this moment, the car lights suddenly flashed not far away, and a black Volkswagen sedan sped over! Lin Fei raised his head and was stunned for a moment. He was so depressed that he almost vomited blood. If he didn't come sooner or later, how did the car find it here? ? But he was in a hurry to save people, so he didn't bother to take care of herself and continued to give the woman artificial respiration. After the car stopped, a man immediately ran out of the cab. \"Stop! What are you doing!?\" Lin Fei looked up and realized that the person chasing him was actually a young and beautiful woman! ? The woman is at least 1.73 meters tall. Her black shoulder-length hair is neatly parted in half, sticking to both sides of her smooth and fair oval face. Under her curved eyebrows, she has a pair of bright eyes with a unique indifference and sharpness. Wearing a black T-shirt and light-colored close-fitting jeans, the curves outlined are like a goddess sculpture by an artist. This is a classical beauty, with an oriental charm all over her body, but she also has a supermodel figure. Suddenly, a strong impact of combined beauty makes it difficult to look away. But no matter how beautiful this woman was, Lin Fei had no intention of admiring her. He looked at the woman who had taken off her shirt and bra, and then looked at the position of his hands. He knew that she must have been misunderstood, but he had no intention of explaining. He only said: \"Miss, whether you believe it or not, I was just helping this woman.\" \"Huh, I just helped the robber escape in the car.\" It's you, who are you lying to? And this is the first time I've seen a man help a woman like this in the middle of the night!\" The beautiful woman obviously didn't believe it. When she saw the two fallen men, she immediately approached Lin Fei step by step. In fact, any normal person would not believe what Lin Fei said. The only one to blame is that this woman's beauty and figure are hard for women not to be tempted by. It's really not something a normal man can resist... Lin Fei stood up helplessly and squinted his eyes. He could tell that this woman was going to do something to him. I thought this woman would yell, but I was a little surprised. Sure enough, the woman gritted her silver teeth, raised a slender beautiful leg, followed a tricky trajectory, and kicked towards Lin Fei with a burst of cold wind! When Lin Fei saw the woman's move, his expression was calm, but he secretly thought: The KGB's fighting skills? Who is this woman?", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}